    <briefdescription>
<para>ROOT/TEve materialization of an FCCVisualization scene. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Defines <ref refid="classfccvis_1_1backend_1_1root_1_1RootScene" kindref="compound">fccvis::backend::root::RootScene</ref>, which connects an abstract FCCVisualization scene to its ROOT/TEve representation.</para>
<para>An abstract <ref refid="classfccvis_1_1scene_1_1Scene" kindref="compound">fccvis::scene::Scene</ref> describes the visualization independently of the rendering backend. RootScene materializes that description into the corresponding ROOT TEve objects, including a <computeroutput>TEveScene</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>TEveViewer</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>Amir H. Ebrahimnezhad <ulink url="mailto:amir.ebh@cern.ch">amir.ebh@cern.ch</ulink></para>
